{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/victoriametrics/vmalert","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:08:35.037Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/victoriametrics/vmalert/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/victoriametrics/vmalert"},"readme":"<img src=\"https://victoriametrics.com/icons/apple-touch-icon.webp\" width=\"150\" alt=\"VictoriaMetrics logo\"/>\n\n</p>\n\n[![Join our SLACK Community](https://img.shields.io/badge/Join%20our%20SLACK%20Community-621773?style=for-the-badge&logo=slack&logoColor=white)](https://inviter.co/victoriametrics/)\n[![File a Bug on GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/File%20a%20Bug%20on%20GitHub-E94600?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/issues)\n[![Source Code](https://img.shields.io/badge/Source%20Code-323232?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/tree/master/app/vminsert)\n</p>\n\n## What is vmalert?\n\n`vmalert` is a service that evaluates Prometheus-compatible alerting and recording rules. It periodically queries a VictoriaMetrics data source, evaluates the rules against the data, and if an alert's condition is met, it fires a notification to a configured Alertmanager instance.\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Image\n\n`vmalert` needs a configuration file for rules, a data source to query, and a notifier URL to send alerts.\n\nRun `vmalert` with local rule files:\n```bash\ndocker run -d --name vmalert -p 8880:8880\\\n  -v /path/to/rules:/etc/rules\\\n  victoriametrics/vmalert:latest\\\n  -rule=/etc/rules/*.yml\\\n  -datasource.url=http://<victoriametrics-addr>:8428\\\n  -notifier.url=http://<alertmanager-addr>:9093\n\n```\n\n* * * * *\n\nConfiguration\n-------------\n\n-   `-rule`: Path to a file or directory with alerting/recording rules in YAML format. Can be specified multiple times.\n\n-   `-datasource.url`: The URL of the VictoriaMetrics data source to query for rule evaluation.\n\n-   `-notifier.url`: The URL of the Alertmanager-compatible notifier to send alerts to.\n\n-   `-httpListenAddr`: The TCP address for `vmalert`'s web interface. Default: `:8880`.\n\n* * * * *\n\nWhere to Get Help\n-----------------\n\n* * * * *\n\nSource Code\n-----------\n\nThe source code for `vmalert` is available in the VictoriaMetrics GitHub repository.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"victoriametrics","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/victoriametrics","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2020-04-21T15:14:33.259975Z","updated":"2026-09-14T07:28:56.436889Z","categories":["Monitoring & observability"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":30489238,"stars":5},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":65760756384,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:ba00566373eb8c72d70cbee123e27ee75292dc0239830f36218c72712ba396b2","pushed":"2026-09-14T07:28:54.954453Z","size":18594655,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v7","unknown/unknown"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"v1.152.0-enterprise-fips","digest":"sha256:421d5e5d2794dba829fed90cdae28a0f2bf40291ccdae7ec096e8a683de616c9","pushed":"2026-09-14T07:25:00.138248Z","size":31400359,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v7"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"v1.152.0-enterprise-scratch","digest":"sha256:e8fe1ca49f1dda6cc2172b33a2d6a6f08ff5ab9c0be64c1870a786ad517f0f52","pushed":"2026-09-14T07:24:50.870454Z","size":31497150,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v7","unknown/unknown"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":"active"}